structured.sv:165:5 u_sub
    instance `u_sub` of module `sub`

    ```systemverilog
    // An instance's overrides are written as values are.
    module sub #(
      parameter cfg_pkg::bus_cfg_t Cfg   = cfg_pkg::Bus,
      parameter cfg_pkg::speed_e   Speed = cfg_pkg::Off
    ) ();
    ```

    overrides `Cfg = '{AddrWidth: 64, DataWidth: 8, Speed: Slow, Mask: 4'd15}, Speed = Fast`

